                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Autistic as hell, but nevertheless, a great RPG.\r\nIf You like:\r\n- a unique setting, where there is a living community of people banished to endless caverns, without the daylight,\r\n- a great, epic story - sometimes cliche, sometimes refreshing, never boring,\r\n- an old-school RPG system, where nothing holds Your hand,\r\nand don't particulary care about:\r\n- slow paced fights,\r\n- extreamly outdated graphics,\r\n- long, slow cooking story,\r\nthen You'll have lots of fun with this game. Just stay on normal difficulty, otherwise the fights will take ages, if You don't pursue an optimised build.",
